步骤 2:
- 目的: 编写并执行 Python 脚本，递归遍历解压后的目录以查找包含 flag 的文件
- 命令: {"tool": "sandbox_python_exec", "purpose": "编写并执行 Python 脚本，递归遍历解压后的目录以查找包含 flag 的文件", "arguments": {"code": "import os\nimport sys\n\ndef search_flag(root_dir):\n    print(f'Starting search in {root_dir}...')\n    for root, dirs, files in os.walk(root_dir):\n        for file in files:\n            if file.endswith('.txt'):\n                full_path = os.path.join(root, file)\n                try:\n                    with open(full_path, 'r', encoding='utf-8', errors='ignore') as f:\n                        content = f.read()\n                        if 'flag' in content.lower():\n                            print(f'Found potential flag in: {full_path}')\n                            print(f'Content: {content}')\n                            return\n                except Exception as e:\n                    pass\n    print('Flag not found.')\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    search_flag('big-zip-files')\n"}}
